  <entry>
    <title>A literate FizzBuzz</title>
    <id>https://pratik.deoghare.com/barkdown/posts/literate-fizzbuzz/</id>
    <published>2026-11-07T00:00:00+01:00</published>
    <updated>2026-11-07T00:00:00+01:00</updated>
    <link href="https://pratik.deoghare.com/barkdown/posts/literate-fizzbuzz/" rel="alternate" type="text/html"></link>
    <category term="literate programming"></category>
    <category term="go"></category>
    <summary type="text">A bag that holds a code block is a named chunk, and a line holding only &lt;&lt;&lt;name&gt;&gt;&gt; links to it. That is how the original barkdown labels code, and it…</summary>
    <content type="html" xml:base="https://pratik.deoghare.com/barkdown/posts/literate-fizzbuzz/">&lt;p&gt;A bag that holds a code block is a named chunk, and a line holding only &lt;code&gt;&amp;lt;&amp;lt;&amp;lt;name&amp;gt;&amp;gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/code&gt; links to it. That is&#xA;how the original barkdown labels code, and it turns a post into a small literate program. Follow the link in the first&#xA;block.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;The program counts from 1 to 100.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;chunk&#34; id=&#34;chunk-fizzbuzz&#34;&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;codeblock&#34;&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;chunk-label&#34;&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;chunk-name&#34; href=&#34;#chunk-fizzbuzz&#34;&gt;⟨fizzbuzz⟩&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;code-head&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lang&#34;&gt;go&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;pre&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-go&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;tok-k&#34;&gt;func&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;tok-f&#34;&gt;main&lt;/span&gt;() {&#xA;&#x9;&lt;span class=&#34;tok-k&#34;&gt;for&lt;/span&gt; i := &lt;span class=&#34;tok-n&#34;&gt;1&lt;/span&gt;; i &amp;lt;= &lt;span class=&#34;tok-n&#34;&gt;100&lt;/span&gt;; i++ {&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;a class=&#34;chunkref&#34; href=&#34;#chunk-print-one-number&#34;&gt;⟨print one number⟩&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&#x9;}&#xA;}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Multiples of 15 are tested first, because they are also multiples of 3 and of 5.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;chunk&#34; id=&#34;chunk-print-one-number&#34;&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;codeblock&#34;&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;chunk-label&#34;&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;chunk-name&#34; href=&#34;#chunk-print-one-number&#34;&gt;⟨print one number⟩&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;code-head&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lang&#34;&gt;go&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;pre&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-go&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;tok-k&#34;&gt;switch&lt;/span&gt; {&#xA;&lt;span class=&#34;tok-k&#34;&gt;case&lt;/span&gt; i%&lt;span class=&#34;tok-n&#34;&gt;15&lt;/span&gt; == &lt;span class=&#34;tok-n&#34;&gt;0&lt;/span&gt;:&#xA;&#x9;fmt.&lt;span class=&#34;tok-f&#34;&gt;Println&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span class=&#34;tok-s&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;FizzBuzz&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;)&#xA;&lt;span class=&#34;tok-k&#34;&gt;case&lt;/span&gt; i%&lt;span class=&#34;tok-n&#34;&gt;3&lt;/span&gt; == &lt;span class=&#34;tok-n&#34;&gt;0&lt;/span&gt;:&#xA;&#x9;fmt.&lt;span class=&#34;tok-f&#34;&gt;Println&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span class=&#34;tok-s&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;Fizz&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;)&#xA;&lt;span class=&#34;tok-k&#34;&gt;case&lt;/span&gt; i%&lt;span class=&#34;tok-n&#34;&gt;5&lt;/span&gt; == &lt;span class=&#34;tok-n&#34;&gt;0&lt;/span&gt;:&#xA;&#x9;fmt.&lt;span class=&#34;tok-f&#34;&gt;Println&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span class=&#34;tok-s&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;Buzz&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;)&#xA;&lt;span class=&#34;tok-k&#34;&gt;default&lt;/span&gt;:&#xA;&#x9;fmt.&lt;span class=&#34;tok-f&#34;&gt;Println&lt;/span&gt;(i)&#xA;}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;</content>
  </entry>
